 inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">)</span> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">경제 및 정책 동향 분석 프로젝트 지원자 모집 </span> \n    <br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">🚩과정 안내</span> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -대상: 국내 15세 이상~34세 이하 미취업 청년(*주 30시간 미만 근무자는 미취업으로 간주, 고용보험 가입 기준) \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -유형: 프로젝트형_연구+R&amp;D직무 \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -방식: 4인 내외 팀 구성&nbsp;→ 직무 기반 실전 프로젝트 수행(기업 배정 주제 부여+팀 과제 수행+1:1 멘토링)&nbsp;→&nbsp;결과물 제출&amp;발표 \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     *팀은 4인 내외로 구성되며 사전에 팀 구성을 하여 신청하고 싶은 경우, 별도로 아래 폼에 기재해주시면 됩니다. \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> <br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">🚩</span> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">전체 일정 *총 2개월 간 진행(4~6월)</span> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -사전직무교육: 4/27(8h), 4/28(8h), 5/2(4h), 5/12(8h), 5/16(4h), 5/19(8h) (총 40h) \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -프로젝트 진행: 5/20~6/14(4주) + 직무 전문가와 함께 하는 1:1멘토링(시간/장소 상의하여 자율 선택) \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -성과공유회: 6/23~6/25 중 하루 <br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings