rgb(32, 33, 36);\">\n     -팀 지원비: 1팀 120만원(4주) \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <br> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">✔️간편 신청 안내</span> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(32, 33, 36);\"> \n    <span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">-신청서 종류(3부): 참여신청서, 개인정보 활용동의서, 지원자격확인서 + 증빙서류(학적확인)</span> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: ini