it; vertical-align: baseline;\">\n       ✨제출 기한: ~4/19(금) 18시까지 \n     </div> \n    </div> \n    <div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"> \n     <br> \n    </div> \n    <div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\n      ⚠️기한 내 제출자 대상으로 1~2일 이내 카카오톡 공지방에 초대할 예정이며 이외 문의사항은 아래의 문의처로 연락 바랍니다.&nbsp;&nbsp; \n     <br> \n    </div> \n    <div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\n      ⚠️해당 양식은 참여자 등록 및 프로그램 참여, 지원금 지급 등 전반적인 프로젝트 수행을 위해 필수 제출하셔야 합니다. \n    </div> \n    <div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">\n      ⚠️제출하지 않는 경우, 참여가 불가함을 안내드립니다.&nbsp; \n    </div> \n   </div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit